  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electron with speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> enters the region between two charged parallel plates midway between the plates, as shown. The potential difference between the plates is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What is the speed of the electron on impact with the plate?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{v^{2}+\\frac{eV}{2m_{e}} }\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{v^{2}+\\frac{eV}{2m_{e}}^{2} }\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{v^{2}+\\frac{eV}{m_{e}} }\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{v^{2}+\\frac{eV}{m_{e}}^{2} }\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
